[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Take a seat. There's something "
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "I want to talk to you about."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Another rule change?"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "No, it's about Henry."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "I want to clear the air."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "Why?"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "We're divorced now, you know."
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "What's that gotta do with me?"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "I don't wanna hear any of that shit."
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "The last time, when you and Henry "
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "fought each other..."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "Yeah, I remember. "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "You stopped us, "
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "instead of letting us settle things "
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "for good, like men."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "But you don't know why"
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "I stopped you.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "I did not want you to have to kill "
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "your brother. Or die yourself."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "What the hell does that mean?"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "You told me a killer wins"
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "by killing!"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "Now you say you want us "
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "both to live!"
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "Make up your damn mind!"
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "They're our fights!"
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "And we know how to end 'em a lot "
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "better than some bitch in the box stand."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "Telling me not to kill-- how many "
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "personalities do you have?!"
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Fu. "
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "So what..."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "You want revenge, right?"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "Your opponents could not "
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "care less about that."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "Once I'm number one, these bullshit "
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "ranking fights are over."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "Got it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "Assassins aren't tools."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "As fucked up as we might be,"
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "we're HUMANS, too!"
  }
]